WEBVTT

00:00:00.665 --> 00:00:01.349
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.537
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Can you pass me the <b>butter</b>?

00:00:06.492 --> 00:00:07.172
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.127 --> 00:00:09.808
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Do you work or <b>study</b>?

00:00:12.862 --> 00:00:13.623
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:14.589 --> 00:00:16.959
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Everything’s going to be fine – don’t <b>worry</b>!

00:00:19.946 --> 00:00:20.681
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:21.623 --> 00:00:23.376
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Your sister’s very <b>young</b>!

00:00:26.412 --> 00:00:27.236
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:28.117 --> 00:00:29.487
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I don’t have any <b>money</b>.

00:00:32.517 --> 00:00:33.307
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:34.279 --> 00:00:36.159
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Please can you take out the <b>rubbish</b>?

00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:39.892
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:40.838 --> 00:00:42.507
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Is today going to be <b>sunny</b>?

00:00:45.537 --> 00:00:46.167
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:47.091 --> 00:00:48.922
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> The weather’s going to be <b>lovely</b>.

00:00:51.982 --> 00:00:52.712
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:00:53.709 --> 00:00:56.494
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Two single rooms, please, and one <b>double</b>.

00:00:59.433 --> 00:01:00.101
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:01.117 --> 00:01:02.421
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> What do you want for <b>lunch</b>?

00:01:05.476 --> 00:01:06.308
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 11

00:01:07.197 --> 00:01:09.151
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What’s the biggest city in your <b>country</b>?

00:01:12.128 --> 00:01:12.985
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 12

00:01:13.866 --> 00:01:17.261
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> She’s usually serious, but she can be very <b>funny</b>.